    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρᾰδ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράζομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>insensate, reckless,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνηστῆρες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.282
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				5.349
			</span></i>; of the dead, <i>without sense, senseless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.476
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφραδέως</span>”
				<i>senselessly, recklessly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.436
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
